Builder: guided mode, one step at a time

Nine steps with a short explanation each: name and price, the prizes, the
credit, the chances (with Fit), what credit is really worth, check the
maths, open it, run it, done (save, hand to developers, compare with
Misty). Each step gates Next until it is complete; a summary strip shows
the box so far. "Everything at once" keeps the previous single-page view.

